      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEZ SO ROYAL (3) added to an impressive strike rate at this circuit and distance when he led from one spot wider and went on to score by 2.7 metres last week. Has the early speed to take advantage of the low draw so looks tough to catch. LOCHINVAR LEADER (7) raced wide from this barrier last week so he'll need better luck but he was going well prior, missing narrowly two back and winning his first four SA starts prior. Worth another chance. NOTGUILTY (6) raced parked before drawing clear to win a maiden by 7m when first-up at Mildura. This is a step up but he is lightly raced and looks to have scope for further progression. B T CAPTIVATE NZ (1) is another that broke the maiden last start and is yet to miss the top-two. This is harder but he draws to advantage.",
